<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:42:06Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>姆巴佩陷入「中國獨裁者」迷因風波：品牌解約、央視停播</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6x2v4p284ylo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:41:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T12:42:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6x2v4p284ylo/trad--854c8c0f141b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6x2v4p284ylo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">因在節目中以「獨裁者」形容已故中國領導人毛澤東，法國足球明星基利安·姆巴佩（麥巴比）近日在中國引發爭議，多家中國大型品牌先後宣佈終止與其合作。姆巴佩發表道歉聲明也不被中國網民接納。</summary></entry><entry><title>武契奇14年執政落幕，中塞「鐵桿友誼」何去何從？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:42:00Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T08:05:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad--bbb377741910.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從總理到總統，武契奇領導的塞爾維亞進步黨（SNS）一步步將塞爾維亞打造成歐洲強硬的親華國家，中國亦曾形容兩國關係為「鐵桿友誼 」。外界關注這一親華總統敗選，將如何改變中塞關係。</summary></entry><entry><title>英國人會改變對梅根的看法嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjqlnge23gkgo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:42:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T06:44:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjqlnge23gkgo/trad--9d698c196f3c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjqlnge23gkgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">薩塞克斯公爵夫人梅根的父親否認性侵他人的指控，但這複雜不斷發展的故事可能會成為梅根人生的轉捩點？</summary></entry><entry><title>「盧拉軍團」的WhatsApp聊天群如何扭轉巴西選情</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c680zjdvk7kgo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:42:06Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T07:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c680zjdvk7kgo/trad--5b6029846225.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c680zjdvk7kgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">雖然民調顯示敗局已定，但數百萬巴西人加入了「盧拉軍團」頻道，後者被認為幫助將線上熱情轉化為現實世界的動員。</summary></entry><entry><title>澳洲囚犯爭取吃Vegemite醬敗訴，為何獄中禁止「國民食物」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx98zq3gze22o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T00:18:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx98zq3gze22o/trad--0c16abc568ac.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx98zq3gze22o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">因謀殺一名地產發展商而入獄的安德烈·麥克肯尼（Andre McKechnie）認為，享受澳洲文化是他的權利。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普重返白宮後，如何從五方面改變美國移民政策？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy83lne67zqo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T00:17:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy83lne67zqo/trad--b152aabcc051.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy83lne67zqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">特朗普承諾封鎖邊境及大規模遣返移民後重返白宮。這兩項標誌性政策如今取得了甚麼成效，又帶來哪些影響？</summary></entry><entry><title>「鐵蛋白臉」真的存在嗎？從外表能否判斷缺鐵？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx4g103g9jnvo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T00:19:12Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx4g103g9jnvo/trad--a26f1fe8ad02.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx4g103g9jnvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些聲稱能發現缺鐵症狀的影片在網路上吸引了數百萬的點擊量。</summary></entry><entry><title>蔡康永稱「沒支持過台獨」後出席蔣萬安造勢 兩岸輿論未息</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckq6nve0my4ro/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T09:17:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckq6nve0my4ro/trad--a213bce599f5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckq6nve0my4ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">分析人士稱，「這根本不是一封求饒的『道歉信』，而是一封向特定市場與群眾溫柔清算的『道別信』」。</summary></entry><entry><title>福田康夫逝世享年90歲 長期親華的「短暫」日本首相</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g149yw14lo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T15:03:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g149yw14lo/trad--e5740235d6b2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g149yw14lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">福田康夫出任日本首相期間才不過一年，當時曾被國內輿論批評為「不負責任」；北京讚揚其對中日關係「作出積極貢獻」。</summary></entry><entry><title>中共五中全會開幕：十三年反腐後，如何繼續「從嚴治黨」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckx2q587wvrqo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T05:07:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckx2q587wvrqo/trad--c1ce3e012a8a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckx2q587wvrqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國政壇至今沒有明確的接班人。受訪專家認為，這反映習近平面臨兩難：不指定接班人有助維持權威，指定接班人則可能提前形成新的權力中心。</summary></entry><entry><title>巴西總統盧拉：北京在美國後院的「老朋友」第四次贏得大選</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj34v4lvvlgo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T10:13:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj34v4lvvlgo/trad--b679607e213d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj34v4lvvlgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">盧拉總統意外獲勝，但他將面對一個充滿敵意的國會和一個兩極分化的國家。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國市場放緩，英國傳統精英私立學校紛紛進軍印度</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwg7xy2mjnl0o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T00:18:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwg7xy2mjnl0o/trad--8997d82eb94c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwg7xy2mjnl0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">多所英國傳統精英私校近年相繼在印度開設分校，瞄準當地日益壯大的富裕階層。隨着中國教育監管收緊，加上英國私校面臨稅務壓力，印度成為新的擴張目標。</summary></entry><entry><title>日本以舉辦世界級活動聞名，但名古屋亞運卻是一片混亂</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1wr84j9xo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T01:12:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1wr84j9xo/trad--1028ec136e1b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1wr84j9xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">飯店混亂、交通事故和外交失誤使組織者和承辦的公司成為焦點。</summary></entry><entry><title>暗影人物：與烏克蘭合作的俄羅斯人</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6eq32qzr0x8o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T09:31:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6eq32qzr0x8o/trad--33f01a49f189.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6eq32qzr0x8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從線人和秘密網絡，到破壞行動及暗殺的指控，俄羅斯與烏克蘭之間的戰爭，正越來越多地在遠離戰場的地方展開。
這場暗影戰爭的許多細節難以核實。不過，《BBC之眼》罕有地接觸到一些俄羅斯人。他們聲稱，自己正通過在俄羅斯境內執行行動，以協助烏克蘭。BBC已確認他們為烏克蘭情報機構工作，但未能獨立核實他們所稱參與的行動。</summary></entry><entry><title>《孤獨的美食家》：一個人吃飯，為什麼能紅遍全亞洲？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6x2wvlxqjr8o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T09:37:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6x2wvlxqjr8o/trad--61c836c7fe01.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6x2wvlxqjr8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">開播至今14年，《孤獨的美食家》從日本深夜劇成長為風靡亞洲的電視作品。觀眾跟隨主角井之頭五郎穿梭街巷尋找美食和故事。主演松重豐希望讓更多海外觀眾透過美食認識日本文化。</summary></entry><entry><title>美沙冬是毒還是藥？從香港經驗看台灣選戰戒毒爭議</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T08:57:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad--3e0e93250f10.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台北市長選舉引發對「美沙冬」（香港稱「美沙酮」）與毒品減害政策的論戰，然而在海峽對岸的香港，這項計劃已運作超過半世紀。為什麼醫學界將其視為有效降低犯罪與血液傳染病的「減害」關鍵？</summary></entry><entry><title>新鴨綠江大橋閒置12年終開通：中朝關係回暖？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T12:46:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad--fac779159e2d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">連接中國與朝鮮的鴨綠江大橋，在閒置12年之後終於正式開通。近年朝鮮與俄羅斯關係愈走愈近，專家分析中方需要透過開通大橋鞏固對朝關係，也被視為關係回暖的象徵。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣AV盛極而衰：中國市場如何催生這場成人片熱潮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T09:37:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad--38da8fdcbc19.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣曾被視為亞洲唯一能合法拍攝無碼成人影片的地區，並在2020年前後快速擴張。隨著片商「麻豆傳媒」停運，外界開始質疑這波繁榮是否與中國市場及博弈資金有關。</summary></entry><entry><title>普京提議中美俄「三方會談」：特朗普響應，北京未表態，基輔反對</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T08:40:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad--076620887441.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在普京建議三方於APEC期間進行會談後，特朗普表示願意參與，強調會談重點將是無核化問題。目前中方尚未就三方會談表態。</summary></entry><entry><title>DeepSeek被美國政府系統禁用：中美AI競爭繼續升溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:42:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad--c79590262ebf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">DeepSeek的免費聊天機器人應用程式在Apple App Store下載排行榜上名列前茅，其AI模型也被美國科技企業採用。Snowflake、Vercel及OpenRouter等公司都已將DeepSeek整合至其提供給客戶的服務中。</summary></entry><entry><title>「特習會」後兩架美國 F-16V 抵台 「雖遲但到」的時機與信號</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:14:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad--32dd398252e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">本周五，台灣在2019年向美國訂購的2架F-16V戰機先行抵達台灣台東空軍志航基地，同批次共有66架同型號戰機，是1990 年代以來台灣首次戰機採購。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>住着一群代孕孩子，美國加州的豪宅如何變成「恐怖之家」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmydgej9w8o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T03:26:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmydgej9w8o/trad--f229e1128309.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmydgej9w8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國加州一棟豪宅因男嬰受傷揭發涉嫌虐童案，屋內住着多名透過代孕出生的孩子。涉案男女被控串謀虐待兒童，事件亦引發外界關注美國代孕產業的監管問題。</summary></entry><entry><title>朝鮮發佈金正恩照片：為何他的死亡傳言總是捲土重來？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1zr53y80o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T14:58:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1zr53y80o/trad--7cbddbcd570f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1zr53y80o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在未經證實的傳言傳開後，朝鮮官媒發布了這位獨裁者與其女兒的照片。</summary></entry><entry><title>為甚麼馬斯克要策劃 SpaceX 與特斯拉的超大型合併？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6eq309002q3o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T00:21:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6eq309002q3o/trad--6bc9a34f4ada.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6eq309002q3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">馬斯克稱，透過合併這兩家公司，「有很多好處可獲得」，而這將會是歷來規模最大的合併案。</summary></entry><entry><title>《決勝時刻》新遊戲設想朝鮮入侵韓國，真的會發生嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj75p1qkyw7vo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T08:44:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj75p1qkyw7vo/trad--fe0ef745b0d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj75p1qkyw7vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在新的《決勝時刻》遊戲中，北韓入侵了南韓。這種情景有多現實？如果真的發生，又會帶來哪些後果？</summary></entry><entry><title>俄羅斯境內反普京破壞行動的隱秘世界</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6d09dpdn294o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T01:14:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6d09dpdn294o/trad--9bdca7ec971e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6d09dpdn294o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">兩名男子講述了他們聲稱在戰爭期間為烏克蘭情報部門提供支援所從事的工作。</summary></entry><entry><title>巴黎騷亂中的三位華人：「激烈的地方激烈，安靜的地方安靜」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckq6n02lqz8vo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T08:59:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckq6n02lqz8vo/trad--3d682414cab9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckq6n02lqz8vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">三位受訪者表示，暴力事件集中於示威區域，市民日常生活並未受到太大影響。但他們對政府能否平息抗議並不樂觀，甚至有人預計，隨著冬季來臨、生活成本上漲，示威還會陸續出現。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普治下，美國經濟的真實表現如何？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgke5j6yego/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T00:21:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgke5j6yego/trad--22ae89b6b05b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgke5j6yego/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中期選舉前夕，特朗普一直吹噓美國經濟的表現。 BBC事實查核（BBC Verify）調查美國的通貨膨脹、就業和經濟成長。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港演員鍾雪瑩、袁澧林發聲之後，她們親述被性別冒犯的經歷</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0v0xnxdvo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T04:37:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0v0xnxdvo/trad--b44a6d14686f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0v0xnxdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC中文訪問了四位來自不同行業的女性，了解言語冒犯是如何在工作環境中出現；當性別冒犯被包裝成「玩笑」，她們是如何應對。</summary></entry><entry><title>遊艇上的水上滑梯、泳池：衛星影像揭示的金正恩「夏宮」生活</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9dzq7z7vw8o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T00:31:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9dzq7z7vw8o/trad--0bc0150d063e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9dzq7z7vw8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC追蹤了一艘長達80米、配有水上滑梯的船隻，旨在進一步了解金正恩如何度過假期——這對大多數朝鮮人而言，是遙不可及的體驗。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣選舉解讀：「北藍南綠」的政治版圖是否「鐵板一塊」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T03:36:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad--e4c721debfd7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「北藍南綠」是描述台灣政治版圖的常見概念，但近年選舉結果顯示，這樣的區域分野並非一成不變，中間選民的流向在這次地方選舉可能左右大局。</summary></entry><entry><title>觀鳥如何重塑大腦，延緩認知衰退？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T06:30:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad--bfe79e2154f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">觀鳥近年愈來愈受長者和認知障礙症患者歡迎。研究人員分析這項活動對他們的身心健康有何影響，以及可能帶來哪些益處。</summary></entry><entry><title>華東颱風強、印尼野火烈——厄爾尼諾現象影響世界的五個方面</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy83vnzql06o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T13:14:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy83vnzql06o/trad--e85bdbc86403.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy83vnzql06o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">有記錄以來最強的厄爾尼諾現象持續增強之際，全球各地已經感受到哪些天氣模式方面的影響？BBC首席氣象預報員莎拉·基斯—盧卡斯（Sarah Keith-Lucas）檢視相關證據。</summary></entry><entry><title>吃什麼能保持年輕肌膚？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckjwe7jzn21no/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T00:21:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckjwe7jzn21no/trad--394936b01b25.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckjwe7jzn21no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">植物、脂肪和發酵食品可以減少皺紋，促進膠原蛋白生長，並改善皮膚質地。</summary></entry><entry><title>翻看英國統計 為何從未吸煙的人也開始對電子煙上癮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3gepg90x6o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T00:17:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3gepg90x6o/trad--619daa0b0a2c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3gepg90x6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">根據英國國家統計局（ONS）數據，目前有超過100萬名電子煙使用者過去從未吸煙。</summary></entry><entry><title>在實體商店購物很令我心煩——為什麼我只在網上購物</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63elnjkg03jo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:40:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T00:17:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63elnjkg03jo/trad--76c2d3eeda4e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63elnjkg03jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">英國服飾零售巨頭Primark首次將推出宅配服務，以應對Shein等超快時尚競爭。網上零售佔比持續上升，專家稱退貨政策成關鍵。</summary></entry></feed>
